   EMISSION; CONTINENTAL COLLISION; SPECTRAL-ANALYSIS; ASTER; CONVERGENCE;
   EVOLUTION; COMPLEX; NEVADA},
Research-Areas = {Geology},
Cited-References = {Abdeen M. M., 2001, P GEOL SOC AM ANN M, V33, P123.
